# WalletConnect Cloud project ID (required for the WalletConnect
# connector to actually work — get one free at https://cloud.reown.com).
# Without it, MetaMask/injected/Safe wallets still work fine; only the
# WalletConnect QR-code connector is degraded.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=

# Real on-chain payment for the $5 card-issuance fee (src/lib/payments.ts,
# src/app/apply/page.tsx) — a real USDG transfer on Robinhood Chain
# MAINNET. This moves actual money. Both vars required or the Apply
# screen shows "Payment not configured yet" and disables the pay
# button — it never falls back to a fake/mock charge.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_TREASURY_ADDRESS: the wallet that receives the fee.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_USDG_ADDRESS: USDG's contract address on Robinhood Chain
#   mainnet — copy it BY HAND from docs.robinhood.com/chain/contracts,
#   don't trust an AI-fetched/summarized copy of it for something that
#   moves real funds. Currently 0x5fc5360D0400a0Fd4f2af552ADD042D716F1d168
#   (verified by the project owner directly against that page,
#   2026-09-11) — re-verify if it's ever in doubt.
NEXT_PUBLIC_TREASURY_ADDRESS=
NEXT_PUBLIC_USDG_ADDRESS=
